WEBVTT

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.410
We lost.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.590
Dynazenon beat us.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:53.130
I see. And that <i>kaiju </i>even
destroyed time and space.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:56.600
People seeing their past and future

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:00.220
should've spawned lots of emotions.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.060
However...

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.480
<i>Kaiju </i>aren't appearing.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.360
Meaning all the <i>kaiju </i>seeds
were wiped out.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:12.110
So, <i>kaiju </i>won't be born anymore?

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.820
We were beaten.

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.910
We lost to Gauma?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:24.160
Their weapon isn't from this era.
It had to come from 5,000 years ago.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.210
If there's no <i>kaiju</i>,
I'll just kill people myself.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:34.630
There has to be something we can do
for the world of <i>kaiju</i>.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.680
For all the <i>kaiju </i>that have fallen.

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:51.070
<i>Kaiju </i>users without <i>kaiju</i>
return to human beings?

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.240
Like Gauma.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:57.490
Senpai, what are you doing?

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.280
Making a resume.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.370
Huh?

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.290
I wonder if I need a suit?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:09.330
Uh... Where'd it go?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.420
Hey, Mom! Have you seen my suit?

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.550
You're kidding me.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.010
This is from my mom.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.260
Hmm? Thanks.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.100
Crab crisps from Toyosu.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.850
Tastes better than river crabs.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:32.150
Tsk! Shaddap!
Get moving or you'll be late.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.320
Yeah.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:46.870
Ugh, I feel like shit.
What's wrong with me?

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.540
Huh? You apologized to the 2nd-year?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.550
After all this time.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:55.960
What are you doing?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:59.470
Picking an entry for the festival.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.300
Yeah?

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.060
Can I use one with you in it?

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.480
Hell no.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.940
So, no more Sizumu?

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.310
Really?

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.690
Could be family issues.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.030
He wasn't very friendly.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.660
I look so weird in this.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.040
Watch over me, Goldburn!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.880
I can't do it after all.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.550
Chise?

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:36.670
Huh?

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.420
Are you okay?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.430
I'm fine, but what's this about?

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:42.720
Goldburn.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.600
Hmm?

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:47.350
Soon, we'll be leaving here for good.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.180
That's sudden.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:55.900
<i>Kaiju </i>shouldn't appear anymore.
We and Goldburn are irregulars here.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:05:00.280
Which is why we're
taking Goldburn with us.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.200
Why?

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:06.330
A world without <i>kaiju</i>
is much more natural.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.540
Prepare your heart.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:19.550
I know that's the way things should be.

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.550
I know, but...

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.800
I just don't get it!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:36.520
Gauma seems out of it lately.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.070
Without his spunk, he's boring.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.360
Right?

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.580
Worried about him?

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.580
Not exactly.

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.710
You are.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:01.840
I knew this day would eventually come.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:07.930
Both Senpai... and you... are leaving me.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:12.520
What do you want?
If you're here to fight, bring it on.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:19.480
No, it seems <i>kaiju </i>won't be
appearing anymore.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.570
We lost.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.950
I came to tell you--

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:33.210
Don't think saying that changes anything!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:37.330
Do you even know the things
that you've done?!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.300
It's about time I teach you!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.590
Gauma! What are you doing?!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.100
Cut it out!

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.100
Violence is bad!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:56.480
Don't ever show your face again!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.150
That was my plan.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:06.990
It's actually sad how little
your punches hurt. That hasn't changed.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.870
<i>Kaiju </i>won't appear anymore?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.540
Is that why you're feeling down?

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.040
Huh? Did it look that way?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.090
Seems like you're out of it lately. Ow.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:30.100
When I revived, I thought Princess would,
too, somewhere in the world.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.600
Princess?

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:35.770
The person you're searching for
is a princess?

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:40.690
Yeah. We vowed to
spend our future together.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:46.070
Which is why after I died,
Princess ended her own life.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.200
Huh?

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.450
How do you know
what happened after you died?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.830
I heard it.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:08:00.330
Princess died so she could meet you!
She followed you into death!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.090
"She wanted to give you this."

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:06.670
Whose voice was it?

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:12.810
I can't remember,
but Princess had a premonition.

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:17.770
She knew I'd need Dynazenon in the future.

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:24.110
But only the <i>kaiju </i>users
were revived, so Princess...

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.740
You won't get to meet her?

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.570
Who knows?

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.830
But I'm glad I came to this place.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:35.580
The scenery's so similar.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:41.960
I doubt we'll need Dynazenon anymore.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.420
I had Koyomi return his.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:53.300
You going somewhere?

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.350
I just might.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.100
What's up?

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:06.940
Nothing. But now that I look at it,
he's actually kinda cool.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.020
Photo Dispenser

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.320
I look awful.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.710
Wh-What?!

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:24.380
I thought I'd come tell you myself.

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:29.840
There probably won't be more <i>kaiju</i>.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.430
I heard.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:35.970
So, no more fighting.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.810
I see.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:44.310
But it's not like I can say
everything's just dandy now.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:49.610
<i>Kaiju </i>have changed me
and everything around me.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.860
Do you despise me?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:58.450
No. You were just doing the duty
you were meant to do.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.290
Well, I despise you.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.380
There it is.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.930
What's that? A mirror?

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:18.760
A 5,000-year-old mirror went missing.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.680
The mirror came to life and vanished?

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.770
I'm thinking it might be Gauma.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:29.190
The mirror? Freaky.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.030
How'd he come back to life?

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.700
A <i>kaiju</i>'s power?

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:34.740
Probably.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:40.450
Princess wasn't a <i>kaiju </i>user,
so she didn't revive.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:44.040
And because of that, they'll never meet.

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:47.130
Must be why he's so bummed.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.130
Yeah.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:01.350
Yomogi, can you come with me
somewhere tomorrow?

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:18.070
Tomorrow, I'm planning
to visit Kano's grave.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.830
That seems sudden.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.870
I guess it is.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.960
When are you going?

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:27.080
Huh?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.630
Need a ride?

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.470
No, I'll be fine on my own.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:40.970
What? I said we're eating
with Kamijo tomorrow.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.890
Sorry.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:45.310
We scheduled around you.

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:46.850
Sorry!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.440
Sorry doesn't cut it.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:54.490
You can eat out whenever,
so what's the big deal?

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:55.690
Eh?

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:02.860
"interview questions"
"Search Results for: suits haircut grooming"

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:03.780
"interview questions"
"Search Results for: interview questions"

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.910
"What are my strengths?"

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:29.190
Make sure you thank him
for all he's done for us, Knight.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:31.110
I know.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.410
What's with the early visit?

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:44.280
We came to say goodbye
since we'll be leaving soon.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.160
Thanks for everything.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:52.670
I see. Thanks for your help. Be safe.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.750
Knight!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.840
Thanks for everything.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.550
Couldn't hear you.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.510
C'mon! Say it even louder!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:20.320
"Minami Family Grave"

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.790
Flowers facing this way?

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.000
That's fine.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.630
I've never visited Kano till now.

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.260
You haven't?

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.760
I kept avoiding it.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:52.100
Minami

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:52.020
My mom was a bit surprised,
but my dad actually looked glad.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:59.610
I swear, my parents drive me nuts.
You don't have that problem, do you?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.280
Well, the thing is...

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.490
Mmm?

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:09.240
A dude I don't know might become my dad.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.580
Yeah?

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.750
Though, he's not a bad guy.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:17.420
We've both got it rough. Oh!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:24.380
I'll tell my ancestors
all my parents do is fight.

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.550
Seriously?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.180
Kidding!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.260
Minami

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:42.030
I've never visited someone else's grave.

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:45.950
I thought if anyone,
maybe you would understand.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.290
I'll return these.

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.620
R-Right.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.140
Thanks.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.940
Isn't this nearby?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.110
What?

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:24.990
He punched a cop
and tried to take his gun.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.860
That'll do it.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.950
What a crazy look.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.450
Let's see.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.410
m 980 597 l 980 667 268 668 268 598

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.410
Self-Proclaimed  'Kaiju Eugenicist

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.410
Suspect Name: Onija / Age: 5021 (Claimed)

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.660
So cool!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.120
Looks bad over there.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.960
It's where the first one appeared.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.880
You brought me there, right?

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.590
Yeah.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:48.470
<i>Kaiju </i>appeared all over the place, huh?

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:51.850
We fought <i>kaiju </i>and stuff,

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:55.680
but it was the closest to normal
my life's ever been.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.650
Normal? How is that normal?

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:02.610
The piloting a robot part wasn't normal.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:06.400
But visiting graves, going swimming,

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.320
missing the festival
and doing fireworks...

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.660
That happened.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:16.960
If there's no <i>kaiju </i>and
we're done with Dynazenon,

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:20.380
won't we not see everyone?

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:24.300
Is my "normal" done for, too?

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:28.880
Deep inside, maybe you just
want to fight them?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:32.180
Maybe Sizumu was right when he said--

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:34.100
Minami.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.680
Hmm?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:40.850
Even if there's no <i>kaiju</i>...
Even if there's no Dynazenon...

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:45.610
...I still want to see you.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:47.900
Yeah.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.340
I like you. Will you go out with me?

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:13.180
I was right to hang around you two.

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:13.970
Huh?

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.600
Sizumu?

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:20.850
Now I get why Gauma died
as a <i>kaiju </i>user and became a human.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.310
Because he's just like you two.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.450
Gauma!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:30.740
Gauma...

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:37.040
Wait. What are you doing?

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:44.330
I knew you'd show up. You've had
your eyes on 'em for a while.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:51.430
I'm grateful to you two. You helped me
witness some wonderful emotions.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:52.760
Thank you.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.560
Gauma, your body!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:03.650
We revived with the power of <i>kaiju</i>,
defying the laws of the world.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:08.860
But being a human,
your body will decay and you'll die.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:15.280
Since we're connected to <i>kaiju</i>,
that won't happen to us.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.460
Wish you would've told me from the start.

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:25.830
If I had, would you have
become a <i>kaiju </i>user?

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:30.300
Quit asking stupid questions.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:19:01.950
The fighting is over, Eugenicist!
You lost all your <i>kaiju</i>!

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.920
I never lose my <i>kaiju</i>.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:16.300
Instance...

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.300
...Domination!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.680
No way! He's...!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.020
There's a <i>kaiju </i>inside him?!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:26.230
<i>Kaiju </i>deserve to be free.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:32.900
Sizumu turned into a <i>kaiju</i>?!

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.950
What's wrong?

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:47.040
I see. Don't worry about me. Go!

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:57.720
Those in the area
should take extreme caution.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.540
New <i>Kaiju </i>Spotted in Tokyo

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.140
<i>Kaiju?</i>

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:10.520
Goldburn!

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:16.360
Call Koyomi. We'll stop him
with Dynazenon.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.950
But you're in no shape for that!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:22.120
Let me handle this.

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:28.040
If I use Goldburn, I can combine
into Dynazenon without any help.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.710
Even so...

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.380
Wait here.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:42.470
Super Dragon King Kaiser Gridknight!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.270
Knight's holding the <i>kaiju </i>back.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.560
Let's get to the hospital!

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:55.030
The hospital can't fix this.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:06.290
Sitting here won't help either!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.750
Gauma?

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.390
Hey, hey... I thought I was dead.

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:43.200
The world of <i>kaiju </i>isn't over just yet!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:16.940
What Wish Can't Come True?

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:16.940
Episode 11
